Cell["\<\
A line can be a vertex list or a walk graph. A list of walks, such as the \
members of a segment, counts as the union of their vertices.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5ba64a40-2d57-4629-9297-6a2a469be58f"],

Cell["\<\
Two lines in the plane meet in at most one point. On a graph two lines can \
share a run of vertices, and they meet where they touch as well as where they \
cross.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"768138ae-3e0a-4c61-8774-73f58ba618bf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The count ",
