Cell["\<\
The members of a segment, each its own entry: the common points are the \
vertices every shortest path passes through. On the grid they are the two \
endpoints:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"996c969b-56af-45c6-8242-cbe6291a8bb6"],

